{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Setlist Strength Log 是一款專為重量訓練而設的紀錄工具，適合進行槓鈴、啞鈴、器械與徒手訓練的人。它以你自己記錄的工作組、次數與 RIR 目標為依據，直接告訴你下一次應該加重、加次數還是減量，運算全部在 iPhone 上完成。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>依自身紀錄判斷加重時機</h2>\n<p>每次訓練以表格展開，欄位包括組數、上次表現、重量、次數與可選的 RIR，勾選一組即自動填入上次數據，並支援熱身、遞減與力竭組。休息計時器會自動開始並通知你。首頁會標示停滯動作與本週各肌群工作組數，內建 167 個動作並附肌群與器材資料。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-406-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-407-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-408-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-409-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-410-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-411-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Setlist Strength Log</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-27T17:57:50.216829+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":335,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}